  = note: for your own newtype over a value that has it, derive it: `#[derive(AtomBitwise)]`
  = note: for a raw pointer to a sized type, `and`, `or`, `xor` and their `fetch_` forms take a `usize` mask on its address; for another pointer, keep tags beside it in a derived pointer word, whose tag fields have `or`, `and` and `xor`
  = note: to change the value in a compare-exchange loop, call `update`
  = note: required for `atomix_core::Atomic<T>` to implement `atomix_core::atomic::capability::TakesBitwiseOperand<T, T>`
